      "content": "7.4 Chief Ministers of Tripura"
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Statehood Day of Tripura is celebrated on January 21 (attained full statehood in 1972 along with Manipur and Meghalaya).",
        "Out of 60 Assembly seats in Tripura, exactly 20 are reserved for Scheduled Tribes (ST) and 10 for Scheduled Castes (SC).",
        "The TTAADC covers roughly two-thirds (around 68%) of the total geographical area of Tripura."
      ],
      "id": "d2kqrkl"
